---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
	<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-12">
		<div class="text-center mb-8">
			<h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl p-1">What is Badger Spill?</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg">Established at UW–Madison in 2009, Badger SPILL now continues as a program of Badger Supports, carrying forward its longstanding mission of helping students feel heard, supported, and less alone. Through its anonymous online peer-support service, students can share what they are going through and receive thoughtful responses, perspectives, and resources from trained Student Supporters, with support and coordination from SPILL Coordinators.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Our Mission</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">To offer empathetic, non-judgmental peer support and to connect students with campus resources when needed. We prioritize safety, confidentiality, and respect for each individual's experience.</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">How It Works</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Submit an anonymous message through our form on the homepage. Trained student responders will read your message and reply with support and resources within 48 hours.</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Volunteer Team</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Our volunteers are UW–Madison students trained in active listening and peer support. If you're interested in volunteering, visit the <a href="/get-involved" class="underline font-semibold">Get Involved</a> page to learn how to join.</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Safety & Limits</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Badger Spill is not a crisis service. If you or someone else is in immediate danger, please call 911 or visit the university's crisis resources on our <a href="/resources" class="underline font-semibold">Resources</a> page.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
			<p class="mt-2">For general inquiries, email us at <a href="mailto:president.badgerspill@gmail.com" class="underline font-semibold">president.badgerspill@gmail.com</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
